{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Generation Gap"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contents. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Some people have been taught that <span class=\"italic\">will</span> is <span class=\"italic\">the future</span> in English. This is not entirely correct. Sometimes when we talk about the future we cannot use <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to talk about future events we believe to be certain.<br><br>We use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>when we want to talk about a plan for the future.<br><br>We use the <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> when the action takes place at a definite point in the future."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Maybe I'll take a class next semester. <br/>I think he'll be okay.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to go a movie this weekend. <br/>His parents are going to be upset for a while. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm leaving for Europe on Monday. <br/>I'm interviewing for a job at 2 p.m. tomorrow.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Personal Qualities and Behavior"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about family, you often describe their personalities and their behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Personality is a person's general character (they way they are). <br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat. </span> <Br><br>Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed but today he seems nervous.</span> <br><br> We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"determined; eager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"adventurous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bold; daring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enthusiastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"keen; passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Nick is stubborn like his father."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Uncle Edward is very conservative. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "My sister is always energetic."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am the most ambitious person in my family."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to move out of the house"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to leave the family home"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My nephew is moving out of the house this month."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear use to talk about family matters."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to see eye to eye"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to agree on different issues"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ted and his father don't see eye to eye. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "generation gap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the difference in the way the young and old see things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is definitely a generation gap between Ted and his father. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "adventurous "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "willing to take risks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's extremely adventurous. He'll go anywhere and try anything. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conservative"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "traditional "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Both of her parents are very conservative. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stubborn"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "determined not to change your mind "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are both stubborn and will not change their thinking. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enthusiastic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being eager and excited "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's enthusiastic about his new job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "energetic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "active; lively "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are both highly energetic and do all types of activities. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cut up index cards into 4 equal parts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the 5 behavior and personality words from the lesson, one on each card."}, {"type": "text", "content": "On the back write a short sentence explaining the word using synonyms. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look up 10 more behavior and personality words. Complete more cards with those words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Bring them to class and try your words with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Draw 2 cards, review the words, then think of a family member, friend or famous person who has those qualities."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find 10 behavior and personality words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I find synonyms for them in a thesa